Package: la-vida
Version: 1.0-1
Section: Games and Amusement
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: python2.6-minimal (>= 2.6.5-1ubuntu6), python-opengl (>= 3.0.0-0ubuntu1), python-pygame (>= 1.9.1release-0ubuntu1), python-soya (>= 0.15~rc1-2), python-numpy (>= 1:1.3.0-3build1)
Maintainer: Puzzler995 <emarsee1@gmail.com>
Description: La Vida
 La Vida is a free and open source game, aiming to be somewhat like The Sims,
 in where you will be in control of your avatar (Dude or Dudette)
 and you will lead your avatar to achieve his/her life goals.
 It is currently in development by a group of members of ubuntuforums.org.
